      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a black hole for money. everything i touch just costs more. i look at my wife and the kids and all i see is how much i'm actually draining them. if i wasn't here, they'd finally be able to breathe again without worrying about how to pay for my mistakes.",
